{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39760392",
      "title": "Outputting Content Conditionally",
      "sourceHash": "3504b0dd0e033c04d090bd3a70d6ea69df06e05b905350ac6e8e3685378659e0",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.51,
          "end": 2.91,
          "en": "So, in this almost finished app here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.91,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "we got this input area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.77,
          "en": "and then we got this results table down here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.77,
          "end": 10.68,
          "en": "But this app still has some flaws.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.68,
          "end": 14.34,
          "en": "Most importantly, if I enter a negative duration,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.34,
          "end": 17.673,
          "en": "in that case my app crashes with an error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.14,
          "end": 22.53,
          "en": "Or if I change the duration to zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.53,
          "end": 24.543,
          "en": "then the same thing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.95,
          "end": 29.58,
          "en": "We also can enter a negative investment amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.58,
          "end": 31.5,
          "en": "though here you could argue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.5,
          "end": 35.76,
          "en": "that this allows you to calculate how liabilities change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.76,
          "end": 37.11,
          "en": "over the years.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.11,
          "end": 39.66,
          "en": "So, that maybe is acceptable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.66,
          "end": 41.01,
          "en": "But the app definitely should",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.01,
          "end": 44.22,
          "en": "not crash if we enter zero here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.22,
          "end": 46.98,
          "en": "Instead, it would be nicer if we would output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.98,
          "end": 49.77,
          "en": "some error message here below the input area,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.77,
          "end": 53.463,
          "en": "hence allowing the user to easily change their input again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 57.21,
          "en": "And therefore, back here in the code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.21,
          "end": 60.18,
          "en": "we want to make sure that this results component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.18,
          "end": 62.79,
          "en": "is output conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.79,
          "end": 65.25,
          "en": "To be precise, it should only be output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.25,
          "end": 67.503,
          "en": "if we have valid user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.61,
          "end": 70.59,
          "en": "And of course, in this app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 70.59,
          "end": 73.11,
          "en": "we can therefore simply add a new constant",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 73.11,
          "end": 77.4,
          "en": "or variable where we derive the information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.4,
          "end": 79.2,
          "en": "whether the input is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 79.2,
          "end": 82.293,
          "en": "or not based on this user input state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 83.19,
          "end": 85.98,
          "en": "And I'll do this here, right below this state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 85.98,
          "end": 89.03999999999999,
          "en": "to keep those related values together,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 89.03999999999999,
          "end": 91.23,
          "en": "even though technically you could of course add it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.23,
          "end": 93.15299999999999,
          "en": "anywhere in this app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 94.35,
          "end": 97.173,
          "en": "But here I'll add a new constant,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 98.19,
          "end": 99.64,
          "en": "which I'll name inputIsValid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 101.85,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "which sounds like a descriptive name to me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.64,
          "en": "And this should be true or false depending",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 107.64,
          "end": 111.09,
          "en": "on whether the user input is valid or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 111.09,
          "end": 115.25999999999999,
          "en": "Now as I just explained, this input here should be valid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 115.25999999999999,
          "end": 118.533,
          "en": "if the duration is at least 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 119.55,
          "end": 122.91,
          "en": "It should not be 0 and it should not be negative.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.91,
          "end": 125.19,
          "en": "For all the other values here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.19,
          "end": 128.49,
          "en": "I can live with negative values since",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 128.49,
          "end": 132.03,
          "en": "you could simply calculate different things with that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 132.03,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "but for the duration, I need to enforce a positive value.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 139.74,
          "en": "And of course, you could also edit this app",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 139.74,
          "end": 143.25,
          "en": "and its code to also enforce positive values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 143.25,
          "end": 146.46,
          "en": "for those other inputs if you wanted to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 146.46,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "But here I'll simply check the duration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 152.55,
          "en": "and therefore inputIsValid should be true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.55,
          "end": 157.55,
          "en": "if userInput.duration is greater or equal than 1.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 158.91,
          "end": 160.683,
          "en": "That's my condition here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.57999999999998,
          "end": 163.63,
          "en": "And if this condition should not be met,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.63,
          "end": 166.143,
          "en": "inputIsValid will be false.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.98,
          "end": 169.95,
          "en": "And therefore, now we can use inputIsValid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.95,
          "end": 173.22,
          "en": "to conditionally render results.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.22,
          "end": 176.01,
          "en": "By simply adding inputIsValid here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.01,
          "end": 178.56,
          "en": "and then using either a ternary expression,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 178.56,
          "end": 182.49,
          "en": "or simply this double ampersand shortcut here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 182.49,
          "end": 185.523,
          "en": "to conditionally render this results component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.26,
          "end": 189.9,
          "en": "And I also want to show a fallback message",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 189.9,
          "end": 191.973,
          "en": "if the input should not be valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 192.9,
          "end": 196.74,
          "en": "So, here we can check if not input is valid,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.74,
          "end": 200.31,
          "en": "and in that case I want to output a paragraph",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.31,
          "end": 205.31,
          "en": "where I simply say, please enter valid input data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.73,
          "end": 209.49,
          "en": "Or maybe, to be more specific,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 209.49,
          "end": 214.49,
          "en": "please enter a duration greater than 0.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 218.91,
          "end": 222.96,
          "en": "And I'll give this paragraph a class name of center,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 222.96,
          "end": 226.44,
          "en": "since this is a class, I defined in the index CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 226.44,
          "end": 228.663,
          "en": "that will make sure that this looks nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 230.57999999999998,
          "end": 232.41,
          "en": "And with that if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 232.41,
          "end": 235.38,
          "en": "I still see my table and I will see my table",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 235.38,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "as I change those inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 237.03,
          "end": 240.42,
          "en": "and you see that the table dynamically recalculates",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 240.42,
          "end": 244.53,
          "en": "as I change those inputs but if I change the duration to 1,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 247.92,
          "en": "it also still works, but if I change it to 0,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 247.92,
          "end": 249.24,
          "en": "you see it breaks,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 249.24,
          "end": 251.31,
          "en": "and if I change it to a negative value,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 251.31,
          "end": 254.85,
          "en": "it also breaks and I see this error message.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 254.85,
          "end": 257.31,
          "en": "But if I go back to a positive number again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 257.31,
          "end": 259.47,
          "en": "this all works again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 259.47,
          "end": 262.023,
          "en": "And that's now the finished app.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}